-- World 2's props (QM, Oct 13). Made by tools/world2_props.py: edit that and
-- re-make this, not this. Run in Studio (Edit, execute_luau) on the place with World2,
-- after the floor scripts and world2_clear. Re-running is fine (it replaces its own).
-- The Rock mesh thread's sets, hugging the walls, the course's middle clear: pines in the
-- Meadow, mushrooms and runestones in the Crimson Lands, crystals and fungi in the
-- Crystal Cavern, birches and the sword in the stone in the Woodland Maze, trees and
-- lanterns down the Temple's sides with tombstones and lily pads (in place of
-- world2_temple's discs), statues, sphinxes and gold in the Ancient Tomb. Big and middle pieces
-- go in World2.Obstacles (smashed when ridden into: an invisible Base footprint and a
-- Tier, like World 1's); small ones in World2.Decor.Props, walk-through.
-- Each piece is cloned from ServerStorage.World2Assets.<Name>: a Model of its coloured
-- MeshParts at the mesh's own size, pivot at its base's middle. (The pines: one of each
-- of the base's, Pine, PineTall and PineSmall, at 1x.)
